{"id":"bd1df970cb50d0b4","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ce-traceable-schnorr-null-cover.md","title":"可枚举可迹性与相对Schnorr零集的Martin-Löf覆盖","display":"thm-ce-traceable-schnorr-null-cover — 可枚举可迹性与相对Schnorr零集的Martin-Löf覆盖","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ce-traceable-schnorr-null-cover","aliases":["43-thm-ce-traceable-schnorr-null-cover"],"display":"thm-ce-traceable-schnorr-null-cover — 可枚举可迹性与相对Schnorr零集的Martin-Löf覆盖","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce-traceable]]","[[43-df-schnorrtest]]","[[43-df-mltest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 16.1.7; printed pp.485–486 / PDF pp.505–506","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ce-traceable-schnorr-null-cover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ce-traceable-schnorr-null-cover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-traceable-schnorr-null-cover — 可枚举可迹性与相对Schnorr零集的Martin-Löf覆盖"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea9cbc7f8cc8654f\" href=\"?note=ea9cbc7f8cc8654f\" title=\"43-df-ce-traceable\">43-df-ce-traceable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 16.1.7; printed pp.485–486 / PDF pp.505–506"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CETraceable}\">\\(\\mathrm{CETraceable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLTest}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ea9cbc7f8cc8654f\" href=\"?note=ea9cbc7f8cc8654f\" title=\"43-df-ce-traceable\">43-df-ce-traceable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CETraceable}(A)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\;\\left[\\mathrm{MLTest}(V)\\land\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}V_n\\right]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CETraceable}(A)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\;\\left[\\mathrm{MLTest}(V)\\land\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}V_n\\right]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>右侧覆盖检验是普通Martin-Löf检验，不能误改成普通Schnorr检验；改成后者对应较强的可计算可迹性。原零集本身无需有效描述，所需内容由检验交集覆盖给出。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 16.1.7; printed pp.485–486 / PDF pp.505–506。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"ea9cbc7f8cc8654f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce-traceable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrtest","status":"resolved","id":"b039951a7138aeff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrtest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"ea9cbc7f8cc8654f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{CETraceable}$、$\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A$、$\\mathrm{MLTest}$ 分别见 [[43-df-ce-traceable]]、[[43-df-schnorrtest]]、[[43-df-mltest]]；$U,V$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrtest","status":"resolved","id":"b039951a7138aeff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{CETraceable}$、$\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A$、$\\mathrm{MLTest}$ 分别见 [[43-df-ce-traceable]]、[[43-df-schnorrtest]]、[[43-df-mltest]]；$U,V$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{CETraceable}$、$\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A$、$\\mathrm{MLTest}$ 分别见 [[43-df-ce-traceable]]、[[43-df-schnorrtest]]、[[43-df-mltest]]；$U,V$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CETraceable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLTest}","display":false},{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CETraceable}(A)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\;\\left[\\mathrm{MLTest}(V)\\land\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}V_n\\right]\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1762,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-407","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ce-traceable-schnorr-null-cover]] — 可枚举可迹性与相对Schnorr零集的Martin-Löf覆盖"}],"outgoing":["ea9cbc7f8cc8654f","b039951a7138aeff","e738767b1d98289f"]}